prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for St. Martin Parish runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025 that same middle ran 55% of normal for August to September and 53% for October to November. So far in 2026 it shows 56% for February to March and 156% for May to June. Grid 11855 had its driest year in 2011 at 64%.</p>"}
